\subsubsection*{Relational Agent architecture}

The StarCraft II (SC2) agent architecture follows closely the one we adopted in Box-World. Here we highlight the changes needed to satisfy SC2 constraints.

\textbf{Input-preprocessing}. At each time step agents are presented with 4 sources of information: \textit{minimap}, \textit{screen}, \textit{player}, and \textit{last-action}. These tensors share the same pre-processing: numerical features are rescaled with a logarithmic transformation and categorical features are embedded into a continuous 10-dimensional space.

